# Combat in steps with real cards: Theo Bell and his .44 Magnum against Beast.
# Each step is a window: the acting minion first, a play returns the impulse to the acting side,
# two passes move on. Moves name the card they come from, in the hand (played) or in play.
# Cards are given by VEKN ID; names and images come from the content pack (LEGAL-08).
seed 5
seat A alice
seat B bob
seat C carol
crypt A 201362 *12
library A 100001 *40
crypt B 200179 *12
library B 101993 *20 100959 *20
crypt C 201542 *12
library C 102065 *40
start

# Fast-forward: Theo Bell and Beast are in play, Theo with a .44 Magnum (sped up for the demo).
A> transfer +7 A:uncontrolled:1
A> move A:uncontrolled:1 ready
B> transfer +7 B:uncontrolled:1
B> move B:uncontrolled:1 ready
C> transfer +5 C:uncontrolled:1
C> move C:uncontrolled:1 ready
A> play A:hand:1 on A:ready:1
expect card A:ready:2 attached A:ready:1
A> next
A> next
expect turn 1 A minion

# Theo bleeds Bob; Beast blocks.
A> bleed A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
expect action bleed A combat
expect combat 1 before-range close

# Before range: Beast plays Torn Signpost for a strength of 2 this combat.
A> pass
B> play B:hand:3
log public Round 1 · Before range: Beast, The Leatherface of Detroit (G2) plays Torn Signpost
A> pass
B> pass

# Range: "Theo Bell maneuvers to long using .44 Magnum". Beast has no maneuver to answer.
A> maneuver long via A:ready:2
log public Round 1 · Range: Theo Bell (G2) maneuvers to long using .44 Magnum
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass

# Strikes: Theo uses the .44 Magnum for 2R damage; Beast's hand strike can't reach at long range.
expect combat 1 strikes long
A> strike 2R via A:ready:2
log public Round 1 · Strikes: Theo Bell (G2) strikes with .44 Magnum: 2R damage
B> strike hand 2
log public Round 1 · Damage: Beast, The Leatherface of Detroit (G2) is about to take 2 damage
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Beast, The Leatherface of Detroit (G2) takes 2 damage and mends it (2 blood)
expect card B:ready:1 blood 5

# Press: neither presses, and the combat ends after the end of the round.
expect combat 1 press long
A> pass round
B> pass round
A> pass
expect action none

# Next, Theo hunts and Beast blocks again. Before strikes, "Beast plays Immortal Grapple": only
# hand strikes this round, so the Magnum stays quiet. Both hand-strike for 1 and mend.
A> unlock A:ready:1
B> unlock B:ready:1
A> hunt A:ready:1
B> block B:ready:1
A> pass
B> pass
C> pass
A> pass
B> pass
A> pass
B> pass
expect combat 1 before-strikes close
A> pass
B> play B:hand:1
log public Round 1 · Before strikes: Beast, The Leatherface of Detroit (G2) plays Immortal Grapple
A> pass
B> pass
A> strike hand
B> strike hand
A> pass
B> pass
log public Round 1 · Damage: Theo Bell (G2) takes 1 damage and mends it (1 blood)
expect card A:ready:1 blood 6
expect card B:ready:1 blood 4
A> pass round
B> pass round
A> pass
expect action none
